/*

        Name:           Generator Control
        Location:       Space Center Sub-Reactor Level
        Description:    This is the workstation that controls the generators. Auxiliary generators (AGs)  power essential computers (generator control and security control) as well as ventilation. Primary generators (PGs) power security systems (robots, fields), manufacturing equipment (handies etc) and non-essential computers (personal stations).

           Created: 14.12.2023. 10:22:24

*/

